    m_Localized: A skeleton bars your path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 899137538
    m_Localized: Your turn. Choose an action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 899137539
    m_Localized: Escaped! Returning to the map.
